Hello <%= @user.first_name.presence || @user.email %>,

<%= @granted_by&.name || @granted_by&.email || 'An administrator' %> has created an account for you to download
<%= @datatable.name %>, <%= @datatable.title %>, <%= @expires_on ? "until #{@expires_on}" : 'with no end date' %>:

<%= @link %>

To start, set your password (this link works for <%= @link_valid_days %> days):

<%= @accept_link %>
<% if @glbrc -%>

If you work at GLBRC, you can skip the password and sign in with your GLBRC account instead.
<% end -%>
<% if @expires_on -%>

We will remind you a week before your access ends.
<% end -%>
<% if @granted_by -%>
If you need it for longer, or the link has stopped working, reply to this email.
<% end -%>
